  "releaseNotes": "8.0.0 Update To .Net 8 ,Update All Packages To Latest Version \n\t\t6.1.0 Encrypted message processor removed. Encrypted messages process by message content type\n\t\t6.0.1 Add encrypted message processor\n\t\t6.0.0 Update to .NET 6\n\t\t5.0.8 Log error message when ServiceBusConfig is not registered in configuration\n\t\t5.0.7 Throw Exception when ServiceBusConfig is not registered in configuration\n\t\t5.0.6 rename classes\n\t\t5.0.5 add base message record\n\t\t5.0.4 add detailed log\n\t\t5.0.3 add detailed log in message processing\n\t\t5.0.2 use cancellation token ni handler\n\t\t5.0.1 Add AddSessionMessageProcessorsFromAssembly method\n\t\t5.0.0 First release for managing Session Message",
